{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18205200","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18205200","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1820520001:0":{"text":"セリス、今の見たか？セインの顔、傑作だったな！あははっ！","source_cn":"爱丝你看见了吗？瑟恩刚才的表情太好玩了！哈哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22A060D3E2EFC3FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1820520002:0":{"text":"うんうん！昔と同じだったわ！","source_cn":"嗯！和以前一模一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E5E77A7FE7F67C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1820520003:0":{"text":"……","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1820520004:1":{"text":"こんな時に、何をやってるんだ！バンティス兵がいつ襲ってくるとも分からないんだぞ！","source_cn":"现在情况危急，你们竟然还有闲心恶作剧？班题斯士兵随时可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DC9EB2356AC3EEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1820520005:0":{"text":"そう怒るなよ。空気を和ませようとしただけじゃないか。じゃなきゃ、セリスや<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さんまで、あんたみたいな仏頂面になっちゃうだろ。","source_cn":"别这样，瑟恩，我只是想活跃一下气氛。总不能让爱丝和<s...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x50B3952590D00985","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"そう怒るなよ。空気を和ませようとしただけじゃないか。じゃなきゃ、セリスや<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さんまで、あんたみたいな仏頂面になっちゃうだろ。","female":"そう怒るなよ。空気を和ませようとしただけじゃないか。じゃなきゃ、セリスや<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さんまで、あんたみたいな仏頂面になっちゃうだろ。","variant_male_record_index":"246072","variant_female_record_index":"246073","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1820520006:0":{"text":"いつもそうだ……なぜお前は、いつもそうなのだ……！","source_cn":"你还是和以前一样……为什么你还是这样？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x944AE229C7A359AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1820520007:0":{"text":"どんなに危険な状況でも、お前は冗談を言って……お前は……","source_cn":"无论身处何种险境，你总有闲心开玩笑……你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFDB0F3C4B375FFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1820520008:0":{"text":"それは、あんたが知ってるバートンで、俺じゃ……えっと、少なくとも今の俺じゃないだろ。","source_cn":"但那是你认识的巴登做的事，不是我。呃，至少不是现在的我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DF2D0D4AC438034","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1820520009:0":{"text":"お前……！","source_cn":"你——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC57B5C8758477EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1820520010:0":{"text":"セインは何か言いかけたが、その言葉を無理やり飲み込んだ。","source_cn":"瑟恩似乎还想说些什么，但话至嘴边，又被他硬生生咽了回去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47853DA5B09B287E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1820520011:0":{"text":"彼は背を向け、それきりあなたたちを見ようとはしなかった。激しく上下する肩から、怒りを必死にこらえていることが分かる。","source_cn":"他转过身去，不再看向你们，激烈起伏的胸膛暴露了他的情绪...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x103642136200F013","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"彼は背を向け、それきりあなたたちを見ようとはしなかった。激しく上下する肩から、怒りを必死にこらえていることが分かる。","female":"彼は背を向け、それきりあなたたちを見ようとはしなかった。激しく上下する肩から、怒りを必死にこらえていることが分かる。","variant_male_record_index":"246079","variant_female_record_index":"246080","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1820520012:0":{"text":"なあ……セイン？","source_cn":"喂……瑟恩？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DF66B94ED2BC5A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1820520013:0":{"text":"まさか、本当に怒ってるのか？ただの冗談じゃないか……","source_cn":"你……你真的生气了？不要这样吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C04E8D27C801240","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1820520014:1":{"text":"レナードはそう言いながら、これ以上怒らせないよう、恐る恐るセインに近づいた。","source_cn":"里纳一边说着，一边小心翼翼地靠近瑟恩，生怕再次点燃他的怒火。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63B0778E8B2E1260","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1820520015:1":{"text":"そのとき、セインが不意に振り向き、素早く剣を抜いて無防備なレナードに斬りかかった――だがレナードは、反射的にその一撃を